// ── Composed document head ────────────────────────────────────────────────
// layouts/application.html.erb — the shared <head>: title, user metas,
// favicon version, the stylesheet link block, custom styles, importmap,
// modulepreloads, and the application import. Dom components cannot splice
// markup inside an element that has element children, so the head is a
// plain string built here and page components emit <body> fragments.
